{"id":44122,"date":"2026-11-08T12:58:34","date_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:58:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=44122"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:58:49","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:58:49","slug":"trail-montes-saloios","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-montes-saloios\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Montes Saloios 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Montes Saloios 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Montes Saloios 2027<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 XII Trail Montes Saloios) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>21 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, na carism\u00e1tica aldeia de <strong>Covas de Ferro<\/strong>, freguesia de Almargem do Bispo, concelho de <strong>Sintra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Moto Clube TT Montes Saloios<\/strong> e pela <strong>Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro<\/strong>, com o apoio t\u00e9cnico da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Faz-te aos Trilhos!<\/strong>, o evento integra oficialmente o <strong>Circuito de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL)<\/strong> nas vertentes Trail Ultra, Trail Longo, Trail Sprint e Trail Jovem (Sub-18 e Sub-20).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com secretariado, partidas e chegadas no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo da Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro<\/strong>, a prova rainha de <strong>Trail Ultra (50 km)<\/strong> arranca \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> (controlo zero \u00e0s 07:45 e tempo limite de 10h00), seguindo-se o <strong>Trail Longo (31 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> (tempo limite de 6h00), o <strong>Trail Sprint (15 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> (tempo limite de 4h00), o <strong>Trail Experience (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> (tempo limite de 3h00) e a <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:45<\/strong>. Os percursos percorrem vales verdejantes, moinhos de vento, pinhais e single tracks t\u00e9cnicos da regi\u00e3o saloia. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-