 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Montes Saloios 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, <strong>21 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, em <strong>Covas de Ferro<\/strong> (Almargem do Bispo, concelho de Sintra, distrito de Lisboa), com partidas entre as 08:00 e as 09:45.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e quais os hor\u00e1rios de entrega de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado, partidas, chegadas e cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio situam-se no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo da Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro<\/strong>. O levantamento de dorsais decorre no s\u00e1bado (20 de fevereiro) das 14:00 \u00e0s 20:00 e no domingo (21 de fevereiro) das 06:00 \u00e0s 08:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios e tempos limite de prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende cinco percursos: <strong>Trail Ultra (50 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 08:00 (limite 10h00), <strong>Trail Longo (31 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 08:30 (limite 6h00), <strong>Trail Sprint (15 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:00 (limite 4h00), <strong>Trail Experience (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:30 (limite 3h00) e <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:45 (limite 4h00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, copo ou recipiente reutiliz\u00e1vel (n\u00e3o existem copos descart\u00e1veis nos PAC), apito e manta de sobreviv\u00eancia. Nos 50 km \u00e9 ainda obrigat\u00f3ria luz frontal e reserva m\u00ednima de 1000 ml de \u00e1gua (500 ml nos 15 km e 10 km; 1000 ml nos 31 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais os valores e prazos das fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 15 de fevereiro de 2027 atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel no topo desta p\u00e1gina, divididas em 3 fases (at\u00e9 15\/09, de 16\/09 a 29\/11 e de 30\/11 a 15\/02): 25 \u20ac\/30 \u20ac\/35 \u20ac (50 km), 18 \u20ac\/21 \u20ac\/25 \u20ac (31 km), 14 \u20ac\/16 \u20ac\/20 \u20ac (15 km), 11 \u20ac\/13 \u20ac\/15 \u20ac (10 km) e 10 \u20ac\/11 \u20ac\/12 \u20ac (Caminhada).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Montes Saloios 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Covas de Ferro, Sintra, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"Participa no XII Trail Montes Saloios a 21 de fevereiro de 2027 em Covas de Ferro, Sintra. Percursos de 50 km, 31 km, 15 km e 10 km. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-montes-saloios-2027.webp\"], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Moto Clube TT Montes Saloios e Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Montes Saloios 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 21 de fevereiro de 2027 , em Covas de Ferro (Almargem do Bispo, concelho de Sintra, distrito de Lisboa), com partidas entre as 08:00 e as 09:45.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funciona o secretariado e quais os hor\u00e1rios de entrega de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado, partidas, chegadas e cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio situam-se no Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo da Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro . O levantamento de dorsais decorre no s\u00e1bado (20 de fevereiro) das 14:00 \u00e0s 20:00 e no domingo (21 de fevereiro) das 06:00 \u00e0s 08:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios e tempos limite de prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento compreende cinco percursos: Trail Ultra (50 km) com partida \u00e0s 08:00 (limite 10h00), Trail Longo (31 km) \u00e0s 08:30 (limite 6h00), Trail Sprint (15 km) \u00e0s 09:00 (limite 4h00), Trail Experience (10 km) \u00e0s 09:30 (limite 3h00) e Caminhada (10 km) \u00e0s 09:45 (limite 4h00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Em todas as dist\u00e2ncias \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, copo ou recipiente reutiliz\u00e1vel (n\u00e3o existem copos descart\u00e1veis nos PAC), apito e manta de sobreviv\u00eancia. Nos 50 km \u00e9 ainda obrigat\u00f3ria luz frontal e reserva m\u00ednima de 1000 ml de \u00e1gua (500 ml nos 15 km e 10 km; 1000 ml nos 31 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais os valores e prazos das fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 15 de fevereiro de 2027 atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel no topo desta p\u00e1gina, divididas em 3 fases (at\u00e9 15\/09, de 16\/09 a 29\/11 e de 30\/11 a 15\/02): 25 \u20ac\/30 \u20ac\/35 \u20ac (50 km), 18 \u20ac\/21 \u20ac\/25 \u20ac (31 km), 14 \u20ac\/16 \u20ac\/20 \u20ac (15 km), 11 \u20ac\/13 \u20ac\/15 \u20ac (10 km) e 10 \u20ac\/11 \u20ac\/12 \u20ac (Caminhada).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66331,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_